DESCRIPTION:Art\nhttps://ma.to/event/open-air-drawing-club-2026-11-07-1\n\
 nThe Open Air Drawing Club is an in-person workshop for all skill levels.
  It begins in the CfM art room with around 15 minutes of introductions\, 
 then heads to Golden Gate Park or Ocean Beach\, depending on the weather\
 , for about an hour of sketching and color studies. The group returns to 
 the studio to spread out and add finishing touches.
